 logtool   

re log start   re compile r ^\ \d\d\d\d\-\d\d-\d\d   
re task received   re compile r   ?\  received  
re task ready   re compile r   ?\  task  
re task info   re compile r   ?  \w\    \    ? \     
re task result   re compile r   ? \w\   \   ?\        

report format task counts list  

     property format n  join          format i task info line  
    m   re task info match line m groups audit init task error trace debug ids   set names results ready   set task types   counter task errors   0 task error task error trace trace debug debug prev line run files line fileinput files feed line task received line  task name  task id names task id    task name ids add task id task types task name     1 task ready line  task name  task id  result ready add task id results task id    result succeeded result task error line  task name  task id  result task error line  task name  task id  result task errors    1 task error task error line  task name  task id  result feed line re log start match line re task received match line  
                task name  task id   task info line task received line  task name  task id re task ready match line  
                task name  task id   task info line 
                result   re task result match line result 
                    result    result groups task ready line  task name  task id  result debug debug line prev line   line trace trace  \n  join filter prev line  line prev line incomplete tasks self ids ready report task    
                 types    task counts task types most common    
                 total   len ids  
                 errors task errors 
                 completed   len ready  
                 succeeded   len ready task errors 
             
         


 click group  
 click context
 handle preload options logtool ctx  
     


 logtool command celerycommand 
 click argument  files   nargs -1 
 click context stats ctx  files  
    ctx obj echo report format format 
          audit   run files  report  
      


 logtool command celerycommand 
 click argument  files   nargs -1 
 click context traces ctx  files  
    audit trace ctx obj echo  run files 


 logtool command celerycommand 
 click argument  files   nargs -1 
 click context errors ctx  files  
    audit task error line      ctx obj echo line   run files 


 logtool command celerycommand 
 click argument  files   nargs -1 
 click context incomplete ctx  files  
    audit   audit  
    audit run files task id audit incomplete tasks   
        ctx obj echo f complete   task id   


 logtool command celerycommand 
 click argument  files   nargs -1 
 click context debug ctx  files  
    audit debug ctx obj echo  run files 
  bin logtool